  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "妹妹遇害第二天，他照常去集训。",
      "sha256": "985534601f925a589010da90ba8fbff4ae9a2f432fe191b544e123b256677fde",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.37,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.63
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "他背着行李，走进集合点。家里，究竟发生了什么？",
      "sha256": "0f98fc1ad868f5f6744e1977208df0bc4204b6976855275d017b1089ece574fb",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.669,
      "atempo": 1.1337,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "时间倒回一天前。东京涩谷，年末的街道依然热闹。",
      "sha256": "cdc4e88a72a8bc29c087e178ea7ef54b5d7e4d12a80cfe3825ee42b93f66154e",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.557,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.443
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "这户人家，父母都是牙科医师。屋里，一切整整齐齐。",
      "sha256": "8a87806636c614c531f815673bdcbb132d79ab6c141eb10be723b9426c61cf34",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.557,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.443
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "长子读牙科。次子勇贵二十一岁，还在为升学复读。",
      "sha256": "0e0be9c8b652589cf7bc499372a68a9bd6016e790688e35a57e6a64a494811d6",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.635,
      "atempo": 1.1059,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "妹妹亚澄二十岁。读短大，也有自己的梦想。",
      "sha256": "4390c4dd02130f74fbc739705cb42420f9a37e94d249bfa682e0660b721368d6",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.068,
      "atempo": 1.0136,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "那天下午，母亲和长子离开家，准备回福岛过年。",
      "sha256": "80bbe54a62f3541e52e250f561f064e74f75ea5a036dd5c87e552c310265d551",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.146,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.854
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "父亲随后也出了门。门一关，家里只剩兄妹两人。",
      "sha256": "405786a41ebf73cb8957e98715624b6fcccd3d4231250bc7ef6e41c89ef47dba",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.355,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.645
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "据他后来的供述，争执中，妹妹提到了梦想。",
      "sha256": "bc36339ff7cf263abdc718ade93a9610feff33073f6097a8728cb9e718016ab6",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.754,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.246
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "他说，她讲了句，你没有梦想。但这不是施暴的理由。",
      "sha256": "91f8a492028c8de5cc10275ba6af2f51e07027445a6fbc0c7b6457463c18c05a",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.46,
      "atempo": 1.0919,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "那天下午，亚澄遇害了。此后的平静，才让人难以理解。",
      "sha256": "f6549e68531f363b3ed92543e21a2a8b21d51b70cb9db32b47f87f01f7b66736",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.825,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.175
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "他关上房门，也把真相留在了屋里。后来，他承认，妹妹的死与自己有关。",
      "sha256": "2bdf3192ad9436905aae236098671c145213fff498478045c4186805119b788f",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 8.229,
      "atempo": 1.1755,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "可当时，他没有报警。他选择了隐瞒。",
      "sha256": "5a8699bee721114157b40b38cb199d97bb2d363e4cfafe83bb6e595006b65307",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.866,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.134
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "更反常的是，第二天，他还照常出门。",
      "sha256": "c722cf6f9538477c81be3f8e19c2e879c38724ac557274dea50fa8786a52d180",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.127,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.873
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "十二月三十一日，他收拾行李，准备去补习班集训。",
      "sha256": "2971c5909e24092cf097cfdf7d65cc81c22bc54e7bbfe75b7ca00c41f9e8eabf",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.545,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.455
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "他背起行李，独自走向补习班的集合点。",
      "sha256": "a0a917021f6ade8375bf824c323ccb78072622b58655a1296404a08494fd99c8",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 91,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.624,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.376
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "集合之后，他随队前往集训。看上去，一切如常。",
      "sha256": "f4ae044bc5dcabc4fc383e5796952b1a5cba2e52db025a9ea58c9c54cb8cd7b7",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 97,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.642,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.358
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "而家里的那扇门，仍紧紧关着。",
      "sha256": "a1e4f0873e7c48ad985024e15b2efaf13d45a491f5f73f47fbe51bf36712bef2",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 103,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.37,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.63
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "一月二日，家人结束返乡行程，回到了东京的家。",
      "sha256": "468f62be91d23fcbb5595e94b7c17bb6ba4d5d34968d07222f8c054730e72c9d",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 108,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.538,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.462
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "可直到三日晚上，母亲才察觉到一股异味。",
      "sha256": "236d4a7445b95352f6bbbb9fa8856fff440c27a0b1e6599a5ae31ac12831c5f5",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.258,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.742
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "她走上三楼，停在儿子的房门前。",
      "sha256": "6bc355990629b854837092ecc301802ffd54b2a646f0086e82feb7a2e879de83",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 120,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.866,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.134
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "真相就此暴露。次日，警方从集训地带走勇贵。",
      "sha256": "b194e885107a0d30a62692546795dbf814f20747657e36b19a2a2000c14c4b74",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 125,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.669,
      "atempo": 1.1337,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "他先否认，随后承认杀人。可法庭的争议，才刚刚开始。",
      "sha256": "4c04f3065833f6afb3949e65b2c19824d277e478434f7aa3c0b5b9c3251d7460",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 130,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.956,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.044
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "法庭争的，不只是他做了什么，还有当时的责任能力。",
      "sha256": "bf354277fbad7ac002095e2705bb80c261d23e27630a0d942341b8018b4a3021",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 137,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.146,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.854
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "辩方主张，事后是另一个人格控制了他。争议，就在这里。",
      "sha256": "1aa46f12d618045aef5944bf786488913c80ed591bb3db7e13dec8919c03c01d",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 144,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.348,
      "atempo": 1.058,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "一审七年。杀人有罪，另一项指控因责任能力问题获判无罪。",
      "sha256": "46ae834b539d362b6a171a6622be04afb8cd5a90d0fd809be8aa99e3906e9f49",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 150,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.34,
      "atempo": 1.2234,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "可二审发现，他在侦查时，能具体讲清经过。",
      "sha256": "8c96ed543de0f08443802ea06b10d441e07672763954b80ad5bfa17ef54f8abb",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 156,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.251,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.749
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "失忆鉴定的前提被推翻。两罪成立，改判十二年。",
      "sha256": "0a3a5591fe592a2366dab5938b5d6919015b92a9cc52b0958f768b5bcfc9f436",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 162,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.146,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.854
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "text": "亚澄的人生，不该被缩成一句话。暴力责任属于施暴者。",
      "sha256": "25e0c915bc04abf1c0b74ec8b64f604851774502c0089532e75f4200e5c793e9",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N09",
      "target_start": 168,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.478,
      "atempo": 1.0797,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S30",
      "file": "S30.mp3",
      "text": "一个家，该怎样对待，被认为不成器的孩子？",
      "sha256": "29e07e1d24f8e2d2104c53e6bafc4e7b6be66a8b3c64e51aa783f5b01a66a550",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声；短句、有停顿、不煽情",
      "narration_id": "N09",
      "target_start": 174,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.068,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.932
    }
  ]
